## AI Coaching
- Integrate personalized workout advice through OpenAI API.
- Provide real-time AI coaching feedback.
- Store and display session history.
- Generate insights and recommendations securely with Supabase MPC.
- Log errors and performance issues via Sentry.io MPC.

## Exercise Management
- Maintain a comprehensive, categorized exercise library.
- Implement an advanced, customizable exercise timer.
- Provide detailed form instructions for exercises.
- Enable users to track and visualize exercise-specific progress.
- Allow marking exercises as favorites.

## Progress Tracking
- Ensure detailed logging for workouts.
- Visualize performance metrics clearly and effectively.
- Allow users to input and track body measurements.
- Enable progress photo uploads and secure management.
- Display exercise-specific progress graphs and a unified analytics dashboard.

## Insights & Analytics
- Provide AI-generated insights based on user activity.
- Analyze performance trends and suggest personalized improvements.
- Track and display user milestones and achievements.
- Offer weekly and monthly performance summaries.

## Gamification System
- Implement a dynamic achievement and reward system.
- Encourage user motivation with streak tracking and level progression.
- Support badge collection for achievements and milestones.

## User Profile & Authentication
- Utilize secure authentication powered by Supabase Auth.
- Allow users to manage profiles, goals, preferences, and medical conditions securely.
- Keep track of complete exercise history within user profiles.

## Security & Performance
- Perform secure computation using Supabase MPC.
- Monitor application stability and performance using Sentry.io MPC.
- Optimize images and assets loading for best mobile performance.
- Ensure secure and encrypted persistence of user data.
- Maintain strict type-safe implementations throughout the app.



- Follow performance optimization practices (memoization, code splitting).